====Rewards====
* Unlocks achievement [[Achievements#Achievements|Little Triumphs]]

===Confirm with Mr. Kerman that all the evidence has been delivered===
Once 8 major evidence have been delivered, talk to Mr. Kerman via the hideout intelligence center laptop screen. After confirming that enough major evidence have been delivered, you will be told to wait for Mr. Kerman's trusted contact to get in touch. '''Note:''' After confirming the major evidence, minor evidence can no longer be handed over.

====Rewards====
* 1x [[Secure container Alpha-1 with TerraGroup evidence]]

===Wait for Mr. Kerman's trusted contact to get in touch===
After 12-24 hours, [[Fence]] will contact you.

===Complete [[Fence]]'s assignments===
====Keep the standing with [[Fence]] above 4.0====
You need to keep your [[Scavs#Scav karma|Scav karma]] over 4.0 for the entire duration of the assignments.

====Extract through the Friendship Bridge (Co-Op) on [[Woods]]====
Extract through the "Friendship Bridge" co-op extraction on [[Woods]] without killing any members of the [[Scavs]] faction or [[The Goons]]. You can lure [[Scavs]] into the extraction with the help of [[Weapons#Smoke grenades|smoke grenades]] to extract with them.
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
File:Friendship Bridge Map.jpg|Extraction marked on map.
File:Scav bridge.png|The extraction.
</gallery></li>

'''Note:''' The objective in the [[Game_modes#PvE_and_PvE_Co-op_game_mode|PvE mode]] is to eliminate 5 PMC operatives on [[Interchange]] in one raid without killing [[Scavs]] instead.

====Extract through the Scav Lands (Co-Op) on [[Reserve]]====
Extract through the "Scav Lands" co-op extraction on [[Reserve]] without killing any members of the [[Scavs]] faction or [[The Goons]]. You can lure [[Scavs]] into the extraction with the help of [[Weapons#Smoke grenades|smoke grenades]] to extract with them.
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
File:Scav Lands Map.png|Extraction marked on map.
File:Scav lands.png|The extraction.
</gallery></li>

'''Note:''' The objective in the [[Game_modes#PvE_and_PvE_Co-op_game_mode|PvE mode]] is to eliminate 5 PMC operatives on [[Shoreline]] in one raid without killing [[Scavs]] instead.

===Tell [[Fence]] that the assignment is complete===
Visit [[Fence]] in the menu through the trader screen.

===Reach 0.4 standing with the [[BTR Driver]]===
To fulfill this objective, you have to complete the quest [[The Price of Independence]].

'''Completing the quest [[Choose Your Friends Wisely]] will fail this objective and end this ending's route.'''

